  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Perdona, joven. ¿Tienes un momento?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720064006F006E0061002C0020006A006F00760065006E002E002000BF005400690065006E0065007300200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F003F00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He tenido una idea buenísima para ofrecer cierto\nservicio, pero la cosa no termina de despegar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero ayudar a quienes tienen problemas para\nconciliar el sueño a causa de las pesadillas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Y sabes qué se me ha ocurrido? Usar Hipnosis\nsobre ellos, ¡así dormirán como un tronco!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es que últimamente hay tanta gente que sufre\npesadillas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730020007100750065002000FA006C00740069006D0061006D0065006E007400650020006800610079002000740061006E00740061002000670065006E007400650020007100750065002000730075006600720065000A007000650073006100640069006C006C00610073002E002E002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que me he topado con el primer\nobstáculo de mi negocio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006300610073006F00200065007300200071007500650020006D006500200068006500200074006F007000610064006F00200063006F006E00200065006C0020007000720069006D00650072000A006F00620073007400E100630075006C006F0020006400650020006D00690020006E00650067006F00630069006F002E00100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El Flamigo que ha traído mi primera clienta no se\nqueda dormido ni a la de tres!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Migo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00690067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quizá tenga demasiada energía almacenada en\nel estómago y eso le impide dormirse?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mu, muuusha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075002C0020006D007500750075007300680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es nuestro primer encargo, así que Musharna\ntambién tiene los nervios a flor de piel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso me gustaría pedirte a ti y a tus Pokémon\nque le mostrarais cómo se hace.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero que empleéis <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sobre el Flamigo y,\nluego, <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, emplead <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> y <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> sobre\neste Flamigo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Musha...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0075007300680061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver si conseguís que mi Flamigo duerma.\nLleva ya tres días sin pegar ojo...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Migo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00690067006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo primero que hay que hacer es usar <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Hipnosis<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C006F0020007000720069006D00650072006F00200071007500650020006800610079002000710075006500200068006100630065007200200065007300200075007300610072002000100002FF000006004800690070006E006F00730069007300100002FF000000002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anda, ¡el Flamigo se ha quedado roque! Venga,\nahora aprovechad para usar <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, el movimiento que toca emplear\na continuación es <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Comesueños<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bien hecho!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004200690065006E00200068006500630068006F002100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Flamigo está durmiendo a pierna suelta.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200046006C0061006D00690067006F002000650073007400E10020006400750072006D00690065006E0064006F0020006100200070006900650072006E00610020007300750065006C00740061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchísimas gracias por conseguir que mi\nFlamigo haya podido conciliar el sueño.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Migooo!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A1004D00690067006F006F006F0021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Después de echarse una cabezadita, mi Flamigo\nparece encontrarse mucho mejor.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Volveremos a usar vuestro servicio!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Lo habéis hecho de maravilla! Teniéndoos como\nejemplo, seguro que Musharna lo hará sin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nproblemas a partir de ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪Mushaaa...♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A004D007500730068006100610061002E002E002E266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias! ¡Ya puedo abrir oficialmente mi negocio!\n¡\"Musha Modorra\" será todo un éxito!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya sabes: si necesitas que alguno de tus\nPokémon eche una cabezada, tráelo aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
